<title>TAJIKISTAN: SOCCER-TAJIKISTAN BEAT TURKMENISTAN 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TAJIKISTAN BEAT TURKMENISTAN 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tajikistan beat Turkmenistan 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-1) in a World Cup Asian zone group eight qualifier</p>
<p>in the Turkmenistan city of Ashgabat on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Turkmenistan - Georgy Tkavadze 15</p>
<p>Tajikistan - Vyacheslav Knyazev 43, 52</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,500</p>
<p>    Standings    P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> China	     3   3   0   0   8   2   9</p>
<p> Tajikistan	3   2   0   1   6   2   6</p>
<p> Turkmenistan    3   1   0   2   4   7   3</p>
<p> Vietnam	   3   0   0   3   2   9   0</p>
<p>Remaining matches: June 1 China v Turkmenistan, Vietnam v</p>
<p>Tajikistan, June 8 China Tajikistan, Vietnam v Turkmenistan,</p>
<p>June 22 China v Vietnam, Tajikistan v Turkmenistan.</p>
</text>
